{"title":"IQOS Fiit","description":"\u003cp\u003eMade for Lil Solid. Fully compatible with IQOS 3 Duo \u0026amp; earlier devices. Fiit is the discovery of the real taste of tobacco and new sensations. Natural tobacco, processed and pressed under a special technology, provides taste and aroma when heated.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"iqos-fiit-regular","title":"IQOS Fiit - Regular","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS Fiit Regular is an aromatic tobacco blend with nutty notes. Made for Lil Solid. Fully compatible with IQOS 3 Duo \u0026amp; earlier devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Fiit is the discovery of the real taste of tobacco and new sensations. Natural tobacco, processed and pressed under a special technology, provides taste and aroma when heated.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA special biopolymer film allows to maintain a comfortable level of temperature and humidity of the tobacco vapor generated when the tobacco is heated.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePrice is per carton and pack. 1 carton contains 10 packs x 20 sticks = 200 sticks. Similarly, 1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"1 PACK","offer_id":41710159003703,"sku":"Fiit Regular - Pack","price":600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41710159036471,"sku":"Fiit Regular- Carton","price":5000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/fiit-regular-carton.jpg?v=1750030832"},{"product_id":"iqos-fiit-regular-sky","title":"IQOS Fiit - Regular Sky","description":"\u003cp\u003eIqos Fiit Regular Sky has a pure tobacco taste, light and unobtrusive. Made for Lil Solid. Fully compatible with IQOS 3 Duo \u0026amp; earlier devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Fiit is the discovery of the real taste of tobacco and new sensations. Natural tobacco, processed and pressed under a special technology, provides taste and aroma when heated.\u003c\/p\u003e\